[00:03.040]You left me in the worst way
{"你以最残忍的方式离开我"}
[00:05.210]Heart torn, leaving blood stains
{"心碎成片　血迹斑斑"}
[00:07.470]All over the tablecloth
{"染透了整张桌布"}
[00:10.000]And I could never scrub them off
{"而我永远无法洗净"}
[00:13.730]But I won't let you haunt me
{"但不会让你阴魂不散"}
[00:15.700]All the scars on my body
{"我身上的所有伤痕"}
[00:17.920]They won't keep me far from love
{"都无法阻挡我去爱"}
[00:20.600]And you won't see me fall apart
{"你更不会看到我崩溃"}
[00:24.670]Cause I turned so cold
{"因我已变得冰冷"}
[00:28.660]And I thought I’d never make it
{"曾以为再也撑不下去"}
[00:31.090]I could feel my pulses fading
{"能感觉到脉搏渐弱"}
[00:35.100]Shed a tear for the love we've lost
{"为逝去的爱落泪"}
[00:37.730]Gotta look for a brand new start
{"必须寻找全新开始"}
[00:40.300]You got me dreaming of a renaissance
{"你让我梦想着重生"}
[00:54.980]A renaissance, a renaissance
{"浴火重生　破茧重生"}
[01:07.140]You left me in the worst way
{"你以最残忍的方式离开我"}
[01:09.060]On the floor, screaming your name
{"瘫倒在地　嘶喊你名字"}
[01:11.240]But I'm sick of always saying no
{"但已厌倦不断拒绝"}
[01:14.000]The way everything unfolds
{"看着一切分崩离析"}
[01:17.710]The time we had
{"我们拥有的时光"}
[01:20.540]Was golden but I look back
{"虽美好如金　但回首时"}
[01:22.570]Wishing that I could have known
{"多希望当初能明白"}
[01:24.540]It'd be easier to let you go
{"放手会更容易些"}
[01:28.790]Cause I turned so cold
{"因我已变得冰冷"}
[01:32.450]And I thought I’d never make it
{"曾以为再也撑不下去"}
[01:35.170]I could feel my pulses fading
{"我能感觉到脉搏逐渐微弱"}
[01:39.110]Shed a tear for the love we've lost
{"为我们逝去的爱落泪"}
[01:41.620]Gotta look for a brand new start
{"必须寻找全新的开始"}
[01:44.470]You got me dreaming of a renaissance
{"你让我梦想着重生"}
[01:48.550]A renaissance
{"文艺复兴"}
[01:59.390]A renaissance
{"文艺复兴"}
